      "created_at": "2015-01-22T01:20:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>After being Stun Bolted, Tachy Nimble Striked Haka for (1-1), who had some shielding up. The shielding was gone after the attack.</p><p>Next time I had Tachy hit Haka after a throat jab from Maia, Shielding not used up.</p><p>Just recently, I played against advance Voss (damage -1), where Maia Stun Bolted Haka (for a second -1), then had Haka use his base power (2 damage) with a Haka of Battle for +1 against Fanatic with Undaunted. The attack was not used up.</p>",
